WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:06.290
To Fox News and right wing media are very
desperately putting together a concerted effort

00:00:06.290 --> 00:00:12.120
to turn these wacky corona virus protesters
into what is essentially a new Tea Party.

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:18.250
And as you may be aware, there have been these
mass gatherings, protests in states where

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:22.189
people are demanding everything be opened
back up, regardless of safety, regardless

00:00:22.189 --> 00:00:23.810
of infection risk.

00:00:23.810 --> 00:00:28.730
And Fox News has been promoting them as if
these are heroes who are doing this rather

00:00:28.730 --> 00:00:32.200
than simply people who are creating a public
health problem.

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:38.120
Here's Judge Jeanine, a Fox News host praising
one protester on her show over the weekend.

00:00:38.120 --> 00:00:47.010
Debbie Dingell, who is the senator, didn't
have nice things to say about you guys.

00:00:47.010 --> 00:00:49.030
And I was rather shocked.

00:00:49.030 --> 00:00:55.370
Here she is, a representative of your state,
criticizing this this peaceful protest.

00:00:55.370 --> 00:00:59.670
And it was pretty peaceful, saying it was
inexcusable.

00:00:59.670 --> 00:01:04.760
What what are Michigan's reaction to her?

00:01:04.760 --> 00:01:09.010
Well, I can tell you, look at Michigan.

00:01:09.010 --> 00:01:10.640
Look, it's the nation.

00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:16.870
What we've done with Operation Gridlock and
has ignited a fire that has spread across

00:01:16.870 --> 00:01:18.490
this entire nation.

00:01:18.490 --> 00:01:21.250
Arizona, Pennsylvania, Texas.

00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:25.640
I mean, today, New York, great example of
gridlock.

00:01:25.640 --> 00:01:28.180
People rising up all across this nation.

00:01:28.180 --> 00:01:30.480
All right.

00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:35.850
And you know, a lot of people are very proud
of you, Michonne, and what you've done and

00:01:35.850 --> 00:01:38.810
let me just say, Debbie Dingell is a congresswoman
and not a senator.

00:01:38.810 --> 00:01:43.150
Of course, the issue isn't actually whether
the protests are peaceful.

00:01:43.150 --> 00:01:45.930
It's whether the protests are putting people
at health risk.

00:01:45.930 --> 00:01:47.659
And of course, they are.

00:01:47.659 --> 00:01:53.670
And as Caleb Carma wrote in Vanity Fair this
Monday, the network and its most important

00:01:53.670 --> 00:01:59.950
viewer, Donald Trump, are amplifying the voices
of a small but vocal minority protesting state

00:01:59.950 --> 00:02:01.470
lockdown orders.

00:02:01.470 --> 00:02:06.400
They are turning these protesters much like
they did around the Tea Party into a principled

00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:08.550
constitutional conservative movement.

00:02:08.550 --> 00:02:12.450
So remember that with the Tea Party, if you
were following politics at the time of the

00:02:12.450 --> 00:02:18.780
Tea Party, you had a movement that knew very
little in terms of facts.

00:02:18.780 --> 00:02:25.260
But that didn't stop them from loudly and
indignantly and furiously in many cases, asking

00:02:25.260 --> 00:02:29.760
for policies that would be bad for them personally.

00:02:29.760 --> 00:02:35.760
But they were policies that their side decided
that they want lower taxes for the rich is

00:02:35.760 --> 00:02:37.570
one that comes to mind.

00:02:37.570 --> 00:02:43.450
You have a very similar situation here, people
who lack facts both about the virus and about

00:02:43.450 --> 00:02:46.010
economics and about just about everything.

00:02:46.010 --> 00:02:51.180
But they are advocating for reopening, which
would be bad for them in the medium term because

00:02:51.180 --> 00:02:56.360
the case spikes will occur and more people
will get sick and more people will die.

00:02:56.360 --> 00:03:00.540
And over the medium term, it will actually
be worse for the economy, not better.

00:03:00.540 --> 00:03:04.130
And you have Fox News and right wing media
cheerleading them.

00:03:04.130 --> 00:03:12.599
Tucker Carlson hosted a protester as well
and thanked them for their service in these

00:03:12.599 --> 00:03:13.599
protests.

00:03:13.599 --> 00:03:18.790
Rush Limbaugh cheered on the protesters by
citing these examples of American bravery

00:03:18.790 --> 00:03:23.210
and sacrifice from the past that have nothing
to do with what these protesters are doing.

00:03:23.210 --> 00:03:28.490
Donald Trump, of course, tweeted over the
weekend, liberate Minnesota, liberate Michigan,

00:03:28.490 --> 00:03:32.360
liberate Virginia and save your great

00:03:32.360 --> 00:03:33.920
Second Amendment.

00:03:33.920 --> 00:03:35.900
It is under siege.

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:42.560
Trump adviser Stephen Moore, who has been
a vector of disinformation lately, Stephen

00:03:42.560 --> 00:03:51.500
Moore called these protesters modern day Rosa
Parks, which really makes no sense.

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:54.330
And in fact, a Washington Post columnist back.

00:03:54.330 --> 00:04:00.720
Max Boot, with whom I don't agree that often
says that it's not Rosa Parks that they should

00:04:00.720 --> 00:04:01.850
be likened to.

00:04:01.850 --> 00:04:03.830
It's really Typhoid Mary.

00:04:03.830 --> 00:04:06.000
That would be a more apt comparison.

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:07.000
Typhoid Mary.

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:08.000
Good.

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:10.390
Google her Google Typhoid Mary if you're interested
in this.

00:04:10.390 --> 00:04:17.169
Typhoid Mary was an Irish woman believed to
have infected 51 people with typhoid fever,

00:04:17.169 --> 00:04:22.240
believed to be the first person in the United
States identified as an asymptomatic carrier

00:04:22.240 --> 00:04:24.469
of typhoid fever.

00:04:24.469 --> 00:04:30.490
That seems like a more apt comparison than
Rosa Parks to these protesters.

00:04:30.490 --> 00:04:34.229
And we have to work really hard to prevent
right wing media from turning these people

00:04:34.229 --> 00:04:35.229
into heroes or

00:04:35.229 --> 00:04:37.960
into martyrs or into whatever they are.

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:39.860
The problem, not the solution.

00:04:39.860 --> 00:04:44.509
And as usual, in Trump world, in Fox world,
everything's backwards noticed.

00:04:44.509 --> 00:04:50.139
By the way, these suppose a small government,
constitutional conservatives, they're not

00:04:50.139 --> 00:04:55.770
protesting the multi-trillion dollar bailout
put together by Trump, which certainly doesn't

00:04:55.770 --> 00:04:57.349
sound like small government.

00:04:57.349 --> 00:04:59.569
Not a peep from them about it.

00:04:59.569 --> 00:05:03.759
There's nothing smart or patriotic about the
protests.

00:05:03.759 --> 00:05:10.039
And yet you see them doing that and not protesting
trillions of dollars in government spending.

00:05:10.039 --> 00:05:12.650
It's a spectacle and it's a pathetic one at
that.

00:05:12.650 --> 00:05:14.759
But it's dangerous no matter what.

00:05:14.759 --> 00:05:17.780
We finally have a real enemy.

00:05:17.780 --> 00:05:21.830
That we should all be united against, we could
all be united against.

00:05:21.830 --> 00:05:26.629
And you have people acting in ways that are
essentially supportive of the virus.

00:05:26.629 --> 00:05:30.349
The way they are behaving spreads the disease.

00:05:30.349 --> 00:05:35.379
It's a level of stupidity and irresponsibility
that should really

00:05:35.379 --> 00:05:36.830
scare us.

00:05:36.830 --> 00:05:41.449
But also the incoherence of the ideology should
