00:05:41.449 --> 00:05:42.449
Government is bad.

00:05:42.449 --> 00:05:45.460
So vote Trump because he's an outsider.

00:05:45.460 --> 00:05:47.249
But government is now good.

00:05:47.249 --> 00:05:52.800
So we should all support Trump and everything
he does, even if he is taking and exercising

